            "review_title": "Review at Pho Container",
            "review_text": "J H\nJapan19 contributions\n0\nLoved the soup base for Pho\nOct 2019\nCame across this restaurant as noticed many good comments on TripAdvisor. \n\nChose the Pho Bo at VND60000 and loved the beef soup base. Portion could be a little bit bigger but really enjoyed the soup and no need to add any additional sauce to make the pho good. The atmosphere is nice and clean and service was really quick. The restaurant is located on a street filled with massage / boutique spa and is a good choice for quick bite before and after a spa treatment. Will surely revisit next time to Da Nang. \n\nStrongly recommend for anyone visiting Da Nang.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 10, 2019",
